# Route: guide 32 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 51 to
# 53, 26 quests, 3.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Felwood, Teldrassil): Felpaw Village -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Deadwood
# Village -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Deadwood Village -> Felpaw Village ->
# Emerald Sanctuary -> Morlos'Aran -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Jadefire Glen ->
# Ruins of Constellas -> Jaedenar -> Shatter Scar Vale -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 4104 Salve via
# Mining; 4105 Salve via Gathering; 4106 Salve via Skinning; 4107 Salve via
# Disenchanting; 5883 Salve via Mining; 5884 Salve via Gathering; 5885 Salve
# via Skinning; 5886 Salve via Disenchanting; 6032 Sacred Cloth.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199).

